{
 "_doc": "Platinum's story chapters (b2tools/story_chapters.py, PEARL_VERSION=platinum, writes this; notes/PLATINUM_CHAPTERS.md is the brief for each). pearl_story.py reads every chapter from here in a Platinum build. _later: the zones of steps 7 (the Distortion World) and 8 (the Battle Frontier), in no chapter.",
